Package: com.ratush.ccvpnonoffauto
Name: CCVPN-ON-OFF-AUTO
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Control Center VPN toggle. Short tap toggles the last-active system VPN on/off; long-press enables AUTO always-on mode (raises VPN memory priority + auto-reconnect watchdog).
Maintainer: ratu.sh
Author: ratu.sh
Section: Tweaks (CCSupport)
Depends: firmware (>=14.0), com.opa334.ccsupport
Homepage: https://ios.ratu.sh
